# Gemini Resume Generation API Reference

This document describes the design, prompt structure, and integration details of the AI Resume Builder using Google Gemini's Structured Outputs API.

---

## 🚀 Native Structured Outputs (Gemini 2.5)

To guarantee that the AI returns highly structured, robust, and clean JSON that conforms exactly to the resume rendering engine, we utilize Gemini's native **Structured Outputs** (`responseSchema`) in `index.html`. 

This eliminates the need for fragile regex cleanup of markdown formatting (e.g. ````json ... ````) and completely avoids JSON parsing errors.

### 1. REST Endpoint Reference
- **URL:** `https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/{model}:generateContent?key={API_KEY}`
- **Method:** `POST`
- **Headers:** `Content-Type: application/json`

---

## 📋 JSON Response Schema Definition

The API is configured to enforce the following strict JSON schema representation for the response payload:

```json
{
  "type": "OBJECT",
  "properties": {
    "name": { 
      "type": "STRING", 
      "description": "Full Name of the candidate" 
    },
    "title": { 
      "type": "STRING", 
      "description": "Professional Title of the candidate" 
    },
    "contact": {
      "type": "OBJECT",
      "properties": {
        "email": { "type": "STRING" },
        "phone": { "type": "STRING" },
        "location": { "type": "STRING" },
        "linkedin": { "type": "STRING" },
        "website": { "type": "STRING" }
      },
      "required": ["email"]
    },
    "summary": { 
      "type": "STRING", 
      "description": "3-4 sentence professional summary tailored to target role" 
    },
    "skills": {
      "type": "OBJECT",
      "properties": {
        "technical": { "type": "ARRAY", "items": { "type": "STRING" } },
        "soft": { "type": "ARRAY", "items": { "type": "STRING" } },
        "tools": { "type": "ARRAY", "items": { "type": "STRING" } },
        "certifications": { "type": "ARRAY", "items": { "type": "STRING" } },
        "languages": { "type": "ARRAY", "items": { "type": "STRING" } }
      }
    },
    "experience": {
      "type": "ARRAY",
      "items": {
        "type": "OBJECT",
        "properties": {
          "title": { "type": "STRING" },
          "company": { "type": "STRING" },
          "duration": { "type": "STRING" },
          "location": { "type": "STRING" },
          "bullets": { "type": "ARRAY", "items": { "type": "STRING" } }
        },
        "required": ["title", "company"]
      }
    },
    "education": {
      "type": "ARRAY",
      "items": {
        "type": "OBJECT",
        "properties": {
          "degree": { "type": "STRING" },
          "school": { "type": "STRING" },
          "year": { "type": "STRING" },
          "gpa": { "type": "STRING" },
          "honors": { "type": "STRING" }
        },
        "required": ["degree", "school"]
      }
    }
  },
  "required": ["name", "title", "summary", "skills", "experience", "education"]
}
```

